cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MislabelBench or its results, please cite it as below, and the SATIVA-epang article."
title: "MislabelBench: a benchmark of taxonomic mislabel detection with known injected errors"
type: software
version: "1.1"
date-released: "2026-10-14"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.23371116"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Aaramis/MislabelBench"
url: "https://github.com/Aaramis/MislabelBench"
abstract: >-
  180 datasets built on GTDB r226 archaeal 16S rRNA with a known number of injected
  taxonomic label errors of seven kinds, a simulated control, and a Nextflow workflow
  that scores SATIVA and SATIVA-epang on them. Code under MIT, data under CC BY-SA 4.0.
keywords:
  - taxonomy
  - mislabelled sequences
  - phylogenetic placement
  - benchmark
  - reference databases
  - EPA-ng
  - nextflow
